# The Vercel project is the static SPA (apps/web) only.
# The API is a long-lived Bun/Express process with a monitoring worker, an MQTT
# subscriber and a file-backed SQLite database, so it cannot run here — see
# docs/DEPLOYMENT.md (Option B). Everything listed below is either a persistent
# host concern or dev tooling, and none of it is needed to build apps/web.
# Delete a line if you later add a Vercel Function that genuinely needs it.

apps/api
hardware
voicebot
docs
scripts
Dockerfile
docker-compose.yml
.dockerignore
env.example

# Build output is generated during the build, so it is never listed here:
# .vercelignore only needs to cover files that are *tracked* in git.
